Subject: alpha/14200: kldstat command has formatting problems on 64-bit machines
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=freebsd-alpha&m=103030573208308


>Number:         14200
>Category:       alpha
>Synopsis:       kldstat command has formatting problems on 64-bit machines
>Confidential:   no
>Severity:       non-critical
>Priority:       medium
>Responsible:    freebsd-alpha
>State:          open
>Quarter:        
>Keywords:       
>Date-Required:
